    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:569e72e117968fcc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "11b590f9da8f9bf16a8fcedf22a79b951c24b85da13d7cf0869292baf8b77368",
      "text": "Day 2 · Pick-up at your hotel in San José for a journey into the Central Mountain Range. Visit an authentic Costa Rican coffee plantation, Doka, to learn about the whole process, from growing and harvesting to the processing plant and roasting. Then climb towards Poás Volcano, past coffee plantations and fern, flower and strawberry farms, to see its main crater and sulphur fumaroles and learn about the park’s ecosystems. Continue to La Paz Waterfall Gardens for lunch and a trail to a spectacular waterfall in the rainforest, with the hummingbird gallery, serpentarium, aviary, butterfly garden and frog exhibit. Return to San José. Overnight at Hotel Palma Real. (B, L)",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1XgRrOBovEvh9uK-1gkdTHrVH0L8lMJYv",
